*
!.gitignore

# Placeholder images shipped with the application, not user uploads.
#
# Six Blade views fall back to uploads/default.png or uploads/no.jpg when a
# product has no image (order-detail-page, cart-page, home-page, global-search,
# product-detail-page). Neither file had ever existed, so those products rendered
# a broken-image icon. They live here because that is where the views look for
# them, but they are part of the application and have to reach every deployment —
# hence the exceptions to the blanket ignore above.
!default.png
!no.jpg
